<main class="page-shell">
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Insurr<span>Brdge</span></a>
    <nav class="hero-actions"><%= link_to "Sign in", sign_in_path, class: "quiet-note" %><%= link_to "Create agency account", sign_up_path, class: "primary-link" %></nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">COMMERCIAL INSURANCE WORKFLOW</p>
    <h1>One submission.<br><span>More markets.</span><br>Clearer decisions.</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">A connected workspace for commercial insurance agencies to prepare accounts, evaluate carrier appetite, track submissions and compare genuine carrier quotes.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="primary-link" href="#workflow">Explore the workflow</a>
      <span class="quiet-note">Early development · Carrier quotes require authorized live integrations</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="workflow" id="workflow">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">THE PLATFORM</p>
      <h2>From business intake to policy lifecycle</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="workflow-grid">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Business intake</h3><p>Capture company details, locations, operations, payroll, revenue and exposures once.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Market appetite</h3><p>Pre-screen markets against product, state, class and underwriting requirements.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Carrier submissions</h3><p>Track each authorized carrier connection independently, including requests for information.</p></article>
      <article><span>04</span><h3>Quote comparison</h3><p>Compare carrier-returned premiums, limits, deductibles, conditions and exclusions.</p></article>
      <article><span>05</span><h3>Bind & policy</h3><p>Coordinate authorized bind requests, documents, policy records and renewals.</p></article>
      <article><span>06</span><h3>Agency operations</h3><p>Manage staff, customer activity, tasks, audit history and agency-level usage.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>InsurrBrdge · Commercial insurance operations · Carrier quotes require authorized live integrations.</footer>
</main>
